	<div class="container-fluid founders" style="background:#fff url(https://www.mantraproperties.in/assets/images/projects-listing/mantra-bg-logo.svg)no-repeat 21rem 14%/contain;">
		<div class="container" style="position: relative;z-index: 2;">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-12 founders__title">
					<span class="tertiary-heading mb-4 d-block">MANTRA SPEAKS</span>
					<h2 class="secondary-heading">Hear From Our Leaders</h2>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="row founders__row">
				<div class="col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 col-xl-4">
					<div class="founders__row-image">
						<img loading="lazy" src="https://www.mantraproperties.in/assets/images/leaderships/mr-vishal-gupta-409322607.png" alt="Mr. Vishal Gupta" class="img-fluid">
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 col-xl-8">
					<div class="founders__row-text">
						<span class="mb-3">
							<svg id="comas" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="73" height="72.862" viewBox="0 0 73 72.862">
								<defs>
									<clipPath id="clip-path">
										<rect id="Rectangle_137" data-name="Rectangle 137" width="73" height="72.862" fill="#35393b" />
									</clipPath>
								</defs>
								<g id="Group_352" data-name="Group 352" transform="translate(0)" clip-path="url(#clip-path)">
									<path id="Path_70" data-name="Path 70" d="M16.809,72.862v-28.4Q16.809,2.356,43.266,0V15.235q-9.557,4.02-9.556,17.871h9.556V72.862Z" transform="translate(29.734 -0.001)" fill="#35393b" />
									<path id="Path_71" data-name="Path 71" d="M0,72.862v-28.4Q0,2.356,26.457,0V15.235Q16.9,19.255,16.9,33.105h9.556V72.862Z" transform="translate(0 -0.001)" fill="#35393b" />
								</g>
							</svg>
						</span>
						<h2 class="secondary-heading mb-4">Mantra has come a long way in our brief history of nearly 19 years.</h2>
						<p class="paragraph mb-4">We have grown along with Pune, where we have witnessed the city evolve from a retirement destination to one of the best cities to live in India. Our customers have been the wellspring of our enlightenment and motivation, entrusting us with their faith. We've harnessed these insights to erect iconic edifices in prime residential precincts of Pune and PCMC. Our ‘mantra’ is to design homes with optimal space utilisation, minimal wastage, ample natural light and air, and a passion to deliver the best homes that our customers have dreamed of. Our partners, employees, and stakeholders support the same ideology and have contributed to making us one of the leading developers in Pune today. We are committed to creating exceptional lifestyle experiences and developing communities that exude the joy of harmonious living.</p>
						<h3>Mr. Vishal Gupta,</h3>
						<h4>Founder &amp; Chairman, Mantra Group</h4>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="row founders__row">
				<div class="col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 col-xl-8">
					<div class="founders__row-text">
						<span class="mb-3">
							<svg id="comas" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="73" height="72.862" viewBox="0 0 73 72.862">
								<defs>
									<clipPath id="clip-path">
										<rect id="Rectangle_137" data-name="Rectangle 137" width="73" height="72.862" fill="#35393b" />
									</clipPath>
								</defs>
								<g id="Group_352" data-name="Group 352" transform="translate(0)" clip-path="url(#clip-path)">
									<path id="Path_70" data-name="Path 70" d="M16.809,72.862v-28.4Q16.809,2.356,43.266,0V15.235q-9.557,4.02-9.556,17.871h9.556V72.862Z" transform="translate(29.734 -0.001)" fill="#35393b" />
									<path id="Path_71" data-name="Path 71" d="M0,72.862v-28.4Q0,2.356,26.457,0V15.235Q16.9,19.255,16.9,33.105h9.556V72.862Z" transform="translate(0 -0.001)" fill="#35393b" />
								</g>
							</svg>
						</span>
						<h2 class="secondary-heading mb-4">Mantra is a young, dynamic and innovative real estate developer in Pune.</h2>
						<p class="paragraph mb-4">We have been pioneering in building perfect homes for the perfect lifestyle. Our projects are meticulously planned, offering amenities designed for everyday living. At Mantra, we consistently observe the evolving needs of our customers and endeavour to create the most enticing opportunities for investing in their dream homes. We have been committed to introducing some of the most innovative offers and that has enabled Mantra to be one of Pune’s fastest growing real estate developers, with projects spanning North, South, East, West of Pune, and PCMC. Our extensive range of inventories and our success is owed to our ability to comprehend the customer’s viewpoint and to go beyond what is required to ensure satisfaction.</p>
						<h3>Mr. Rohit Gupta,</h3>
						<h4>Managing Director, Mantra Group</h4>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 col-xl-4">
					<div class="founders__row-image text-end">
						<img loading="lazy" src="https://www.mantraproperties.in/assets/images/leaderships/1782379512028-908308955.webp" alt="Mr. Rohit Gupta" class="img-fluid">
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
		</div>
	</div>
	
	
