					<span class="tertiary-heading mb-4 d-block">OUR JOURNEY</span>
					<h2 class="secondary-heading mb-4">Key Milestones</h2>
					<p class="paragraph mb-0"> We have grown rapidly across Pune since our inception in 2007. We have always aimed to provide our customers with exceptional value by deeply understanding their needs. Our innovative smart designs and unwavering quality, transparency and on-time delivery have earned us the trust of our customers and the market and make brilliance happen across all our endeavours. We are proud of our achievements: </p>
