					<span class="tertiary-heading mb-4 d-block">MANTRA BUSINESS</span>
					<h2 class="secondary-heading mb-4">Our Businesses</h2>
					<p class="paragraph"> Mantra Properties story is a testimony to the group's longstanding commitment to quality, be it in real estate, trade or any other industry. Established more than five years ago as a retail establishment by Puranchand Gupta, the group grew progressively into businesses that have established a benchmark of quality and trust. </p>
				</div>
			</div>
