						</div>
						<div class="caption">
							<div class="caption__left">
								<h3 class="secondary-heading mb-3">Markets &amp; Markets</h3>
								<p class="paragraph">A B2B research business that tracks 30,000 high growth emerging opportunities/threats influencing over 70% of global companies’ revenues. It assists over 7500 clients internationally, including 80% of the world’s leading 1000 companies.</p>
							</div>
